        "answer": {
          "short": "$x=-\\frac17,\\ y=\\frac97$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}1-2x&=5x+2\\\\-7x&=1\\\\x&=-\\frac17\\\\y&=1-2\\left(-\\frac17\\right)\\\\y&=\\frac97\\end{align*}$$\nCheck: $1-2(-\\frac{1}{7})=\\frac{9}{7}$ and $5(-\\frac{1}{7})+2=\\frac{9}{7}$.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 52
      },
      {
        "id": "p25-q2-f",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "f",
        "prompt": "$$\\begin{aligned}x&=\\frac y3+2\\\\7x-5y&=10\\end{aligned}$$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$x=\\frac52,\\ y=\\frac32$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}7\\left(\\frac y3+2\\right)-5y&=10\\\\\\frac{7y}{3}+14-5y&=10\\\\-\\frac{8y}{3}&=-4\\\\y&=\\frac32\\\\x&=\\frac{\\frac32}{3}+2\\\\x&=\\frac52\\end{align*}$$\nCheck: $\\frac{(\\frac{3}{2})}{3}+2=\\frac{5}{2}$ and $7(\\frac{5}{2})-5(\\frac{3}{2})=10$.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
